  "problem": "Question: A doctor is to visit a patient. From the past experience, it is known that the probabilities that he will come by train, bus, scooter or by other means of transport are respectively 3/10, 1/5, 1/10 and 2/5. The probabilities that he will be late are 1/4, 1/3 and 1/12. If he is late, what is the probability that he comes by train?",
  "steps": [
    {
      "step_id": 1,
      "text": "Answer: Let E be the event that the doctor visits the patient late and let T1, T2, T3, T4 be the events that the doctor comes by train, bus, scooter, and other means of transport respectively.",
