    {
      "step_id": 9,
      "text": "Thus, P(T1|E) = \\frac{\\frac{3}{40}}{\\frac{3}{40} + \\frac{1}{15} + \\frac{1}{120}} = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}",
      "latex": "P(T_1|E) = \\frac{\\frac{3}{40}}{\\frac{3}{40} + \\frac{1}{15} + \\frac{1}{120}} = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}",
